---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Legal & Security | Haitao Zheng" description="Legal, privacy, and security posture for tzheng.dev.">
  <main class="article-body">
    <span class="eyebrow"><span class="dot"></span>privacy-first static website / security note</span>
    <h1>Legal & Security.</h1>
    <section>
      <h2>Impressum</h2>
      <p>This is a personal portfolio, engineering log, and learning website by Haitao Zheng.</p>
      <p>Contact: <a class="link" href="mailto:h@tzheng.dev">h@tzheng.dev</a></p>
      <p>This page is a lightweight information page for a non-commercial personal site, not a legal service or business platform.</p>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h2>Security posture</h2>
      <p>This domain is routed through Cloudflare nameservers, giving the site an edge layer for HTTPS delivery, DNS protection, caching, and basic abuse filtering before traffic reaches the static site.</p>
      <p>No account system, no public login surface, and no intentional analytics trackers or advertising pixels are added by this site.</p>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h2>Copyright & usage</h2>
      <p>Unless otherwise noted, the personal writing and presentation material on this site belong to Haitao Zheng.</p>
      <p>Referenced technologies, school names, logos, and GitHub projects remain the property of their respective owners.</p>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
